AI adoption is not the day the tool goes live. It is the day your people st=
op=0Agoing back to their own spreadsheet.=0A=C2=A0=E2=80=8C=C2=A0=E2=80=8C=
=C2=A0=E2=80=8C=C2=A0=E2=80=8C=C2=A0=E2=80=8C=C2=A0=E2=80=8C=C2=A0=E2=80=8C=
