<p style="margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&apos;Segoe UI&apos;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:23px;color:#cccccc;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;">Watching people go back to the spreadsheet, or already tracking adoption metrics? Hit reply, I read every one. Bill</p>
